                </div>
                <div
                  style="color: var(--text-tertiary); font-size: var(--text-xs);"
                >
                  small favor - civic guard remembers her
                </div>
              </article>
              <article
                style="border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid var(--sphere-spirit); background: linear-gradient(90deg, color-mix(in srgb, var(--sphere-spirit-bright) 18%, transparent), transparent); padding: 8px 10px;"
              >
                <div
                  style="color: var(--sphere-spirit-bright); font-size: var(--text-xs); text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.1em;"
                >
                  Vow - Active Now
                </div>
                <div
                  style="color: var(--text-primary); font-size: var(--text-sm);"
                >
                  Vow to the small folk
                </div>
                <div
                  style="color: var(--text-tertiary); font-size: var(--text-xs); font-style: italic;"
                >
                  she will not crush a frightened man
                </div>
